    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The ball chases the mouse cursor.</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1698570/extras/211a7305b02ac26bdf4f9d4a44464e44.poster.avif?t=1629370735\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1698570/extras/211a7305b02ac26bdf4f9d4a44464e44.webm?t=1629370735\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1698570/extras/211a7305b02ac26bdf4f9d4a44464e44.mp4?t=1629370735\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gameplay</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1698570/extras/c51ec2ae1232614b1e2a2c0382182f7d.poster.avif?t=1629370735\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1698570/extras/c51ec2ae1232614b1e2a2c0382182f7d.webm?t=1629370735\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1698570/extras/c51ec2ae1232614b1e2a2c0382182f7d.mp4?t=1629370735\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Go through all circles and dodge all the obstacles to advance levels.<br></li><li>The ball accelerates and decelerates according to the distance it is from the cursor.</li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Innovative gameplay.<br></li><li> Dozens of levels.<br></li><li> Minimalist design.<br></li><li> Simple controls.</li></ul>",
